🔥🔔 Fire Alarm Integration – One System, Complete Protection! 🛡️

A Fire Alarm Integration System connects fire detection with building services to ensure a fast, coordinated, and safe emergency response. 🚨

✅ Detect smoke and fire using intelligent detectors 🔥
✅ Activate audible and visual alarm devices 📢🚨
✅ Interface with clean agent or sprinkler systems 💧
✅ Shut down HVAC and close fire/smoke dampers ❄️
✅ Recall elevators and unlock emergency exit doors 🛗🚪
✅ Monitor and control all events through the Fire Alarm Control Panel (FACP) 📊

💡 Proper fire alarm integration enhances life safety, protects critical assets, and minimizes damage by ensuring every connected system responds automatically during a fire. 👷‍♂️🔥
